<!-- Template Description -->
== Usage ==
This template displays a filtered list of youtaite articles.

=== Show youtaite by alphabet ===
To display all youtaite whose names start with a specific letter:

'''Examples:'''<br/>
{{T|YoutaiteListFiltered|alphabet|A}}<br/>
{{T|YoutaiteListFiltered|alphabet|M}}<br/>
{{T|YoutaiteListFiltered|alphabet|T}}

This will show all youtaite whose names begin with that letter, sorted alphabetically.

=== Show non-alphabetical entries ===

To display youtaite whose names don't start with A-Z (like symbols, numbers, or special characters):

<pre>
{{YoutaiteListFiltered|other}}
</pre>

This catches entries that come before "A" in sorting order and after "Z" - basically anything that doesn't fit the regular alphabet.

==Syntax==
{{T|YoutaiteListFiltered|v1=mode|v2=alphabet (optional)|v3=count=number}}

===Parameter===
{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Required !! Description
|-
| {{Para|1}} || Yes || Mode selector: use <code>alphabet</code> for alphabetical filtering, or <code>other</code> for non-alphabetical entries
|-
| {{Para|2}} || Conditional || The letter to filter by (only needed when using <code>alphabet</code> mode)
|-
| {{Para|count}} || No || Maximum number of results to display (defaults to 600 if not specified)
|}

== Complete Example ==

Here's how you might structure a full youtaite listing page:

<pre>
== Symbols & Numbers ==
{{YoutaiteListFiltered|other}}

== A ==
{{YoutaiteListFiltered|alphabet|A}}

== B ==
{{YoutaiteListFiltered|alphabet|B}}

== C ==
{{YoutaiteListFiltered|alphabet|C}}

... and so on for each letter
</pre>

== Troubleshooting ==
'''Not seeing any results?'''
* Make sure you spelled the mode correctly (<code>alphabet</code>, <code>number</code>, or <code>other</code>)
* Check that you included the letter when using <code>alphabet</code> mode
* Verify that youtaite in that category actually exist in the wiki

'''Too many results?'''
* Add the <code>count</code> parameter to limit results: <code><nowiki>{{YoutaiteListFiltered|alphabet|A|count=50}}</nowiki></code>

==Examples==
{{T|YoutaiteListFiltered|p1=alphabet|p2=A|_Y_=1}}
{{clr}}
{{T|YoutaiteListFiltered|p1=number|p2=|_Y_=1}}
{{clr}}
{{T|YoutaiteListFiltered|p1=other|p2=|_Y_=1}}
{{clr}}

